    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Miss Tatjana!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Oh... it's you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "I'm so glad... you're alright..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "You look much better."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Hehe... maybe I really do push myself too hard, if I'm always falling down at times like this."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "I've been... forcing myself not to think about Thor. But his smile... his pain... the fire burning his body..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "I'm sorry. I'm doing it again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "It's okay."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "We both... know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "But at least the killer paid for what he did."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Maybe."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Miss Folinic?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "No... never mind..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "You're right."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "But Wolumonde... still has a lot of problems ahead of her..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "First and foremost, the Infected..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "I'm sorry. I actually knew about Mr. Severin's condition. He asked me not to tell anyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "I should have told everyone as soon as he talked about using Originium Arts to operate the refrigeration unit in the control room."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "But... He's in a lot of pain too. Everyone is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Those who couldn't bear it... have already been thrown in jail."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "The rest... are just like me."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
