    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Click",
        "text": "Everyone! Over here!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_328_cammou",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "The route has been mapped out, and I believe a small group could make it back to Rhodes Island safely."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_328_cammou",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Click",
        "text": "Wow, that was an unforgettable experience. Should I document it? Or try to forget it anyway?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_328_cammou",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "Just don't use it to make money."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_328_cammou",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Click",
        "text": "Give me a little credit!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
            "name2": "char_294_ayer",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "This route... Would this route allow the people of Wolumonde to evacuate safely?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
            "name2": "char_294_ayer",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "Hard to say... That's a lot of people, with even more wounded and prisoners. You can't leave the prisoners to die."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Right. Where's GreyThroat?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "She... left. She had to see someone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "She'll join us later."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Oh? I'll go get her."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "There's no need for\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "No... There is."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "I'm going to get her."
    },
