            "name": "avg_npc_065"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "We should elect a new Schultz at once!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "But after all he's done for us, we shouldn't be so fickle."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_065"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "E-even so, we can't let an Infected wander the streets in broad daylight."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "We should decide after we see the results of Schultz Severin's medical examination. He might..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_065"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "No matter what the examination says, we can't have an Infected leading us! What will the nobles say?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "Would tourists or merchants come to a town patrolled by an Infected?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "Hey! Hey!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "Outpost reports a convoy approaching! They're flying a Gendarmerie flag!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_065"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "L-let's go see if the receiver still works. We have to confirm their IFF\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
