    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the midst of the crowd's debate, the former Schultz, Severin Hawthorn himself, has long since fallen asleep from exhaustion."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
