            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "He continues to dream of leaning against his sickle, looking out over fields of golden wheat."
    },
    {
        "text": "He laughs in his dream, until he weeps."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is the first time he's cried since losing his son."
